2026-02-01 10:50:26 | INFO | "./webui\batch_video_generator.py:152": generate_single_video - task.start completed with result: {'videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\281a83c4-1907-43f0-8481-9a88f4159107\\final-1.mp4'], 'combined_videos': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\281a83c4-1907-43f0-8481-9a88f4159107\\combined-1.mp4'], 'script': "Forget bland pollock soup; the first secret to a mind-blowing flavor explosion is how you prep your pollock. Gently rehydrate your dried pollock by soaking it in rice water for just ten minutes, then carefully squeeze out the excess moisture, ensuring no fishy smell lingers. Now, quickly stir-fry this rehydrated pollock in a hot pan with a whisper of sesame oil and finely minced garlic until it becomes fragrant and slightly golden. This initial sautéing step is absolutely critical, caramelizing the pollock and infusing it with an incredible depth and nutty aroma that regular boiling simply cannot achieve, thereby setting a powerful foundation for unmatched deliciousness. Next, the broth itself must sing with an unforgettable umami richness that transforms the entire dish. Instead of plain water, build your base with a robust anchovy dashi or a meticulously simmered vegetable broth, letting it gently infuse with thinly sliced radishes and a few rehydrated dried shiitake mushrooms for an unparalleled, earthy depth. Season your simmering broth thoughtfully with a touch of good quality fish sauce, a dash of Korean soup soy sauce, and a generous pinch of white pepper, tasting and adjusting until you achieve that perfect savory balance. This layered seasoning approach ensures every single spoonful delivers a complex, satisfying warmth that will genuinely leave you craving more and wondering about its secret. Finally, elevate your masterpiece with the ultimate finishing touches that transform a mere soup into something absolutely divine and memorable. Swirl in one or two lightly beaten eggs just before serving for a wonderfully silken texture and a subtle, gentle richness that complements the pollock beautifully. Then, shower generously with an abundance of freshly chopped green onions and a final, fragrant drizzle of toasted sesame oil right into the steaming bowl for an aromatic burst. For an optional, vibrant kick that awakens the palate, stir in a tiny spoonful of gochugaru and a freshly crushed garlic clove right at the very end, just enough to bloom their flavors without overcooking. This isn't just soup; it's an intensely flavorful, soul-satisfying experience that will make you wonder how you ever ate dried pollock soup any other way.", 'terms': ['dried pollock', 'rice water', 'stir fry', 'whisked egg', 'bukeoguk'], 'audio_file': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\281a83c4-1907-43f0-8481-9a88f4159107\\audio.mp3', 'audio_duration': 150, 'subtitle_path': 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\tasks\\281a83c4-1907-43f0-8481-9a88f4159107\\subtitle.srt', 'materials': ['C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-42f0b0a3a1e8f8521a77ce0c80c61087.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-b24ac66ab28ac99326d4c0d2ccf4a9b5.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-848506c5ef60ef3fe4baaed3eb00a056.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-d1c6b27c8128e8aa9cfa5e1d37ed5595.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-082e376de3333581cfda54259edfbf16.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-019d811eeb7e98f55cbe847154a87e0b.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-0b3d7227fd59ecb017c798bbdb5e2985.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-1be1b6ce73069a6ef299b37c9525c758.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-706ce0b6be8399487b2f93690aaac632.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cache_videos/vid-6765c545ddd8c8757051e606c6c620d6.mp4', 'C:\\Users\\dev\\youtube-auto\\storage\\cach