2026-02-02 16:29:49 | DEBUG | "./app\services\task.py:86": generate_script - video script: 
Aging weakens our body's strongest shield, immunity, making us vulnerable to frequent infections and chronic diseases. But there's no need to despair. You can fully restore your fading immunity against the tide of aging. Here, I will tell you the key strategies to reactivate your body's defense system. You can reawaken your immunity!

80% of your immunity resides in your gut. Every day, consume plenty of various colored vegetables, fruits, and fermented foods like kimchi or yogurt. Essential nutrients like Vitamins C, D, Zinc, and beneficial bacteria strengthen gut health, which in turn leads to powerful immunity. Maintaining a healthy gut is the first step in establishing a strong immune front within your body.

Regular exercise stimulates immune cell activity. Even just 30 minutes of brisk walking a day can significantly boost your immunity. Furthermore, sufficient sleep is key to immune recovery. 7-8 hours of deep sleep every night is a precious time for your immune system to produce cytokines and reorganize your body. Lack of sleep severely weakens immunity.

Chronic stress is a major culprit that erodes immunity. Find peace of mind through meditation, deep breathing, or engaging in your favorite hobbies. A positive mindset and social connections also act as powerful immune boosters.

Don't let aging claim your immunity. Actively boost your immunity and reclaim a vibrant life.
